ster.avif?t=1738813345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252680/extras/c211bbf41a45d71484c6ec75338f7063.webm?t=1738813345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252680/extras/c211bbf41a45d71484c6ec75338f7063.mp4?t=1738813345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252680/extras/698362bd29353c56042d8d5d8cd6deb1.avif?t=1738813345\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the solar system and restore it to its former glory!</strong></h2><br>A whole planet at a bargain price? Perhaps there\u2019s a reason for that... Maybe things won\u2019t be as simple as they first seemed!",
